message.content:
This is **not notifiable**. The garden office is a detached single-storey building with a floor area under 15 m² and no sleeping accommodation. That makes it an exempt building under Schedule 2, Class VI of the Building Regulations 2010 (via regulation 9). Building its timber-frame walls therefore needs no building notice or full plans application.

A small residual chance of another route is left in case the building sits close to a boundary or is over a sewer.

